Q22. A student’s ID, name, and class ID are recorded in the Student table. Which of the
following is the SQL statement that returns records of all students whose names start with A?
a)   SELECT * FROM Student WHERE name LIKE ’%A’;
b)
SELECT * FROM Student WHERE name LIKE ‘%A_’;
c)   SELECT * FROM Student WHERE name LIKE ‘A_’;
d)   SELECT * FROM Student WHERE name LIKE ‘A%’;
